},
"mappings": {
"dynamic": false,
"properties": {
"field_name1": {
"type": "keyword"
}
}
}
}
Even if they rarely change, having settings and mappings deﬁned centrally in OpenSearch is
simpler to manage than updating multiple upstream clients.
